    "name":  "Solar LED Garden Spike Light - RGB+CCT - IP65",
    "reference":  "91702",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe\u003cstrong\u003e LED solar garden\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003espike\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eCCT + RGB light\u003c/strong\u003e colour is a stylish and modern option that is \u003cstrong\u003esolar powered\u003c/strong\u003e and emits a pleasant light. Discover the magic of outdoor lighting with RGB Lights plus three shades of white 3000K 4000K, 6000K and elevate your outdoor space to a new level of style and ambience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this\u003cstrong\u003e outdoor solar spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e you can enjoy the flexibility to switch between warm and cool light tones as well as a full range of vibrant colours. Start enjoying it now!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eSolar Garden Spike Light LED - RGB+CCT - IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransform your \u003cstrong\u003egarden\u003c/strong\u003e into an oasis of light and colour with the captivating \u003cstrong\u003eRGB+CCT Solar LED Spike Lights\u003c/strong\u003e. Designed to deliver a one-of-a-kind lighting experience, these versatile \u003cstrong\u003eoutdoor\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e solar spotlights\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;are ideal for enhancing the beauty of your outdoor space. Their water resistance guarantees long-lasting performance, letting you enjoy magical nights under the starry sky.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant: It does not save memory.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDescription of the functions:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1. Rear ON/OFF button: Press the button on the back to switch the lamp on and off. It does not have a memory function, so it does not remember the last working mode when it is switched on.\u003cbr\u003e2. In total it offers \u003cstrong\u003e10 colours:\u003c/strong\u003e Warm white (3000k), Natural white (4000k), Cool white (6000k), Red, Green, Blue, Cyan, Purple, Sky blue, White blue.\u003cbr\u003e3. There are two working modes:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA-Colour change: Ten colours change automatically every 5 seconds.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eB-Always on with a single colour: Change the colours by touching the body of the lamp. When the mode is changed, the first colour, warm white (3000k), comes with the breathing mode. Wait 5 seconds for the colour to change automatically.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBrilliant features: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine being able to personalise your garden lighting to match your mood or the occasion. The RGB+CCT Solar LED Spike Lights give you the freedom to choose from a wide range of colours and light temperatures, from warm, welcoming tones to vibrant flashes of colour. These versatile spotlights let you create unique atmospheres at the touch of a button.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDurability above all: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether it rains or the sun shines, the Solar LED Spike Lights are water-resistant with an \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e rating, which means they are built to withstand a variety of weather conditions. In winter or in summer, you can trust these solar spotlights to keep their quality and performance, giving you reliable lighting at all times.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSustainability in every ray of light: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs well as their outstanding performance, the Solar LED Spike Lights are environmentally friendly. Running on \u003cstrong\u003esolar energy,\u003c/strong\u003e they help you reduce your carbon footprint while lighting up your garden. Forget about cables and electricity bills, and embrace a sustainable option that helps look after the planet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSimple installation:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstalling the Solar LED Spike Lights is quick and easy. With their smart, compact design, you can place them anywhere in your garden without any hassle. Whether on the lawn, along a stone path or around shrubs, these spotlights blend perfectly into any setting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreate a magical setting:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine the magical nights ahead with the RGB+CCT Solar LED Spike Lights. Whether for an intimate dinner outdoors, a get-together with friends or simply relaxing under the stars, these lights will turn your garden into a dreamlike setting, full of colour and charm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBring your garden to life with the lighting it deserves. Discover the beauty of the RGB+CCT Solar LED Spike Lights and experience the magic of light and colour in every corner. Click to get yours today and start creating unforgettable moments in your outdoor space!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide every element required for WHOLESALE DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or SALE, including the technical data sheet for each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
